---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How deload handles your data."
>
  <section class="px-6 pt-20 pb-24 md:pt-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink/50">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-medium leading-[1.1] tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
        Privacy policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink/50">Last updated: TBD</p>

      {/* TODO: replace this placeholder with reviewed legal copy before launch. */}
      <div class="prose mt-10 max-w-none text-ink/80">
        <p class="text-lg">
          This is placeholder copy. The final privacy policy will explain, in plain English, what data deload collects from coaches and athletes, how we use it, how long we keep it, and who we share it with (short answer: nobody we don't have to).
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-medium text-ink">What we collect</h2>
        <p>Account information, the programs you write, and the session data athletes log inside the app.</p>
        <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-medium text-ink">How we use it</h2>
        <p>To run the product, to improve it, and to support you when you ask for help. We do not sell athlete data.</p>
        <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-medium text-ink">Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can export your data and delete your account at any time from inside the app.</p>
        <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-ink/50">
          Questions? Reach us via the contact page.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
